hic  though her 1883 character doesn't last  beyond the first pair of premier  episodes  claire dutton was the unforgettable type  of character that audiences love to hate  and it would be a shame if that were the  last we saw of her  romani immigrant noemi plays more of a  background role through the first half  of 1883 season 1 but slowly becomes one  of its most important characters  lost and alone after the death of her  husband she charms and romances the  pinkerton agent thomas and the two are  now one of the show's best couples  a newcomer to the screen actress  gratiella brancusi plays the widow  noemie in her first professional acting  role a former marketing executive for  the la based theater company the actors  gang she's recently switched careers to  become an actor and is already  impressing audiences as the haunted  noemi  according to the sun audiences familiar  with the world of celebrity gossip may  recognize her as the now ex-wife of  shawshank redemption star tim robbins  but based on her performance so far in  1883 she's very likely about to become a  better known name on her own merits  episode 6 boring the devil sees a gruff  short-tempered cook join the caravan  the appropriately nicknamed cookie is  hired by thomas to be their resident  cook and is paid handsomely to make sure  everyone in the group has good meals on  their journey  however his sour mood riles up the ire  of margaret dutton when he curses in  front of her young son he also tends to  defy shea and james which gets him into  trouble playing the role of cookie is an  actor that fans of taylor sheridan's  other works will surely be familiar with  james jordan jordan appeared in the  sheridan pen film wind river and in both  of sheridan's two other recent hits the  1883 parent series yellowstone and the  paramount plus crime drama mayor of  kingstown  in yellowstone jordan plays similarly  harassable livestock agent sergeant  steve hendon who works under casey  dutton and gets in